6338,"en":"I know you are safe"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l004","ordinal":186339,"en":"I'm an orphan if I'm safe"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l005","ordinal":186340,"en":"Talk to Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l006","ordinal":186341,"en":"I was saying salad."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l007","ordinal":186342,"en":"Abakesi shordunu"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l008","ordinal":186343,"en":"Separated from Kakan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l009","ordinal":186344,"en":"I was going to get it!"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l010","ordinal":186345,"en":"Thick Kyrgyz bag"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l011","ordinal":186346,"en":"When your grandfather Karakan died,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l012","ordinal":186347,"en":"Black Chinese, San Manjuu"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l013","ordinal":186348,"en":"When they carried out a blood raid,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l014","ordinal":186349,"en":"He is a brave nation"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l015","ordinal":186350,"en":"When you shave together without stopping,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l016","ordinal":186351,"en":"Eight sons of Karakan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l017","ordinal":186352,"en":"Younger than his father,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l018","ordinal":186353,"en":"Drunk without reason,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l019","ordinal":186354,"en":"Alööke, khan of the Manchu,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l020","ordinal":186355,"en":"That we will be enemies,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l021","ordinal":186356,"en":"When you hate eight,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l022","ordinal":186357,"en":"Eight sons of Karakan"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l023","ordinal":186358,"en":"When measuring the whip*,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l024","ordinal":186359,"en":"Children who winked"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l025","ordinal":186360,"en":"When it is destroyed"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l026","ordinal":186361,"en":"Destroyed the stone market,"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l027","ordinal":186362,"en":"When separated at all."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l028","ordinal":186363,"en":"Unbelievable rage"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l029","ordinal":186364,"en":"He put eight."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l030","ordinal":186365,"en":"See the chaos"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l031","ordinal":186366,"en":"Slave to different"},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l032","ordinal":186367,"en":"Separate us all."},{"id":"semetey-2-2013:p0016:b003:l033","ordinal":186368,"en":"The day passed with slavery,"}]
